15:["$","section","Impact of update on Aspirants",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Impact of update on Aspirants"}],[["$","p","Now that we know about the new mandates and requirements for getting admission to medical colleges/universities abroad, it seems to be harder than before to be able to enroll in a field that was never easy before and now has become even more difficult than ever!",{"children":"Now that we know about the new mandates and requirements for getting admission to medical colleges/universities abroad, it seems to be harder than before to be able to enroll in a field that was never easy before and now has become even more difficult than ever!"}],["$","p","But, here are our two cents on the whole issue, and our advice on how to tackle it.",{"children":"But, here are our two cents on the whole issue, and our advice on how to tackle it."}],["$","p","First of all, the option of not appearing for NEET was desirable as it saved the students from facing disappointment in the form of a low score due to poor performance.",{"children":"First of all, the option of not appearing for NEET was desirable as it saved the students from facing disappointment in the form of a low score due to poor performance."}],["$","p","Secondly, most students prefer studying in India itself since they are not aware of the benefits of studying dentistry abroad.",{"children":"Secondly, most students prefer studying in India itself since they are not aware of the benefits of studying dentistry abroad."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
16:["$","section","The course of Action for students appearing for NEET",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The course of Action for students appearing for NEET"}],[["$","p","If the new condition worries you, One Window is here to help you with a brilliant strategy to successfully enroll for admission to a good medical college/university abroad and secure your career and future in a few simple steps!",{"children":"If the new condition worries you, One Window is here to help you with a brilliant strategy to successfully enroll for admission to a good medical college/university abroad and secure your career and future in a few simple steps!"}],["$","p","Prepare for NEET with complete dedication and without a doubt. Honestly, if you score well, you have the world’s worth to achieve and if you don’t you’ve got nothing to lose. Step in to prepare for your exams with this mindset and take it easy.",{"children":"Prepare for NEET with complete dedication and without a doubt. Honestly, if you score well, you have the world’s worth to achieve and if you don’t you’ve got nothing to lose. Step in to prepare for your exams with this mindset and take it easy."}],["$","p","Appear for exams and go through the examination process calmly.",{"children":"Appear for exams and go through the examination process calmly."}],["$","p","Look into the benefits of studying dentistry abroad before you start preparing or while you wait for your results.",{"children":"Look into the benefits of studying dentistry abroad before you start preparing or while you wait for your results."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
17:["$","section","medical schools/colleges/universities abroad",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"medical schools/colleges/universities abroad"}],[["$","p","that admit Indian students and accept NEET Scores but have a low cut-off rate.",{"children":"that admit Indian students and accept NEET Scores but have a low cut-off rate."}],["$","p","Trust us, there are plenty of reputed colleges and universities abroad that have a very low NEET Score cut-off rate waiting for brilliant minds to take admission with them and make them into exceptional professionals!",{"children":"Trust us, there are plenty of reputed colleges and universities abroad that have a very low NEET Score cut-off rate waiting for brilliant minds to take admission with them and make them into exceptional professionals!"}],["$","p","Benefits of Studying Dentistry Abroad!",{"children":"Benefits of Studying Dentistry Abroad!"}],["$","p","Since most students do not know of the benefits, we are here to list down all the advantages of getting admission to a medical college abroad:",{"children":"Since most students do not know of the benefits, we are here to list down all the advantages of getting admission to a medical college abroad:"}],["$","p","Quality Medical Education facility is provided to Indian students.",{"children":"Quality Medical Education facility is provided to Indian students."}],["$","p","Admission to these colleges does not require a deposit of any capitation fee.",{"children":"Admission to these colleges does not require a deposit of any capitation fee."}],["$","p","The study environment is quite safe and engaging.",{"children":"The study environment is quite safe and engaging."}],["$","p","The highly advanced and modern infrastructure of International Universities.",{"children":"The highly advanced and modern infrastructure of International Universities."}],["$","p","Affordable accommodation and food costs.",{"children":"Affordable accommodation and food costs."}],["$","p","Bright career opportunities for medical graduates.",{"children":"Bright career opportunities for medical graduates."}],["$","p","Option to go for Post graduation and MD courses with ease.",{"children":"Option to go for Post graduation and MD courses with ease."}],["$","p","Not only WHO & MCI but also many global bodies have recognized medical universities located in different nations.",{"children":"Not only WHO & MCI but also many global bodies have recognized medical universities located in different nations."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
18:["$","section","[content_block id=14313 slug=zoho-form]",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"[content_block id=14313 slug=zoho-form]"}],[["$","p","Which Countries (and colleges) are best for students aspiring to study Dentistry abroad?",{"children":"Which Countries (and colleges) are best for students aspiring to study Dentistry abroad?"}],["$","p","Sweden",{"children":"Sweden"}],["$","p","Sweden has universities that specialize in dentistry whose education system has a global presence in the world and the medical industry in the country is quite advanced.",{"children":"Sweden has universities that specialize in dentistry whose education system has a global presence in the world and the medical industry in the country is quite advanced."}],["$","p","Karolinska Institute",{"children":"Karolinska Institute"}],["$","p","The University of Gothenburg",{"children":"The University of Gothenburg"}],["$","p","Malmo University",{"children":"Malmo University"}],["$","p","China",{"children":"China"}],["$","p","China offers a world-class education in dental training because it has clinical learning & teaching facilities that are commendable and the technology most modern in the world.",{"children":"China offers a world-class education in dental training because it has clinical learning & teaching facilities that are commendable and the technology most modern in the world."}],["$","p","Some of the best colleges are :",{"children":"Some of the best colleges are :"}],["$","p","Hong Kong University",{"children":"Hong Kong University"}],["$","p","Peking University",{"children":"Peking University"}],["$","p","Sichuan University",{"children":"Sichuan University"}],["$","p","Hong Kong University",{"children":"Hong Kong University"}],["$","p","Belgium",{"children":"Belgium"}],["$","p","Belgium offers a very high salary rate to dentists and an efficient education system. With some of the world’s top-ranked universities situated in it, Belgium provides education for very cheap tuition fees.",{"children":"Belgium offers a very high salary rate to dentists and an efficient education system. With some of the world’s top-ranked universities situated in it, Belgium provides education for very cheap tuition fees."}],["$","p","Some Universities are:",{"children":"Some Universities are:"}],["$","p","KU Leuven",{"children":"KU Leuven"}],["$","p","Ghent University",{"children":"Ghent University"}],["$","p","University of Liege",{"children":"University of Liege"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
19:["$","section","University of Liege",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"University of Liege"}],[["$","p","With these steps, any student can land admission and pursue a successful career with a decent learning experience in a reputed medical college/university abroad.",{"children":"With these steps, any student can land admission and pursue a successful career with a decent learning experience in a reputed medical college/university abroad."}],["$","p","The options are not limited to just these countries and listed universities, there are many different options per your performance and preferences— to know more about them reach out to us at",{"children":"The options are not limited to just these countries and listed universities, there are many different options per your performance and preferences— to know more about them reach out to us at"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
